+// RUN: triton-opt %s --triton-rewrite-tensor-descriptor-to-pointer=inbounds-fast-path=true --canonicalize --cse --split-input-file | FileCheck %s
+
+// =============================================================================
+// Test: When offsets are compile-time constants that are provably in bounds,
+// the scf.if condition folds to true and canonicalize eliminates the dead
